From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Araceae Runtime <runtime@araceae.invalid>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:45:20 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Hand refused provider credentials to auth command refreshes

Record the bearer credential each request attempt actually carried and pass
it through unauthorized recovery to the external auth refresh. The provider
auth command receives it as ARACEAE_PROVIDER_AUTH_REJECTED_TOKEN on refreshes
only, so a credential source shared by concurrent requests can rotate exactly
the refused credential and return the current one for stale refusals.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
